text: ['({T}: Add {G}.)', '({T}: Add {R}.)', '({T}: Add {U}.)', '({T}: Add {W}.)', "As long as you control a Yanling planeswalker, Moon-Eating Dog has flying. (It can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)", 'Breath of Fire deals 2 damage to target creature.', 'Cleansing Screech deals 4 damage to any target.', "Dragon's Presence deals 5 damage to target attacking or blocking creature.", 'Draw three cards.', "Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature can't be blocked.", 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +3/+3.', 'Flying\nWhenever one or more creatures you control attack, you gain 1 life for each attacking creature.', 'Flying\n{2}{R}: Creatures you control get +1/+0 until end of turn.', "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)\nWelkin Tern can block only creatures with flying.", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)\nWhenever Fire-Omen Crane attacks, it deals 1 damage to target creature an opponent controls.", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)\nWhenever Heavenly Qilin attacks, another target creature you control gains flying until end of turn.", 'Meandering River enters the battlefield tapped.\n{T}: Add {W} or {U}.', 'Reach (This creature can block creatures with flying.)', "Return target creature to its owner's hand.", "Return up to two target creatures to their owner's hand.\nSearch your library and/or graveyard for a card named Mu Yanling, reveal it, and put it into your hand. If you searched your library this way, shuffle.", 'Search your library and graveyard for a basic land card and a card named Jiang Yanggu, reveal them, put them into your hand, then shuffle.', 'Target creature gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', "Target creature gets +4/+4 and gains trample until end of turn. (It can deal excess combat damage to the player or planeswalker it's attacking.)", "Target creature you control deals damage equal to its power to target creature you don't control.", 'Timber Gorge enters the battlefield tapped.\n{T}: Add {R} or {G}.', "Trample (This creature can deal excess combat damage to the player or planeswalker it's attacking.)", "Vivid Flying Fish has flying as long as it's attacking. (It can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)", 'When Earth-Origin Yak enters the battlefield, creatures you control get +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'When Purple-Crystal Crab dies, draw a card.', 'Whenever Nine-Tail White Fox deals combat damage to a player, draw a card.', 'Whenever Reckless Pangolin attacks, it gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', "[+1]: Target creature gets +2/+2 until end of turn.\n[−1]: If you don't control a creature named Mowu, create Mowu, a legendary 3/3 green Dog creature token.\n[−5]: Until end of turn, target creature gains trample and gets +X/+X, where X is the number of lands you control.", "[+2]: Target creature can't be blocked this turn.\n[−3]: Draw two cards.\n[−10]: Tap all creatures your opponents control. You take an extra turn after this one.", '{3}{G}, {T}: You gain 4 life. Activate only if you control a Yanggu planeswalker.']
